# In a function that calls itself a marked object fails the test of instanceof and goes the long way, so a read behind the test takes the slot for filled.
# RUN: walk f3:Body mechanisms=all
# CHECK: = ShapeTest v0 layouts=[L0] [rejectsMarkedObjects]
# CHECK: = GetSlot {{*}}key="car" receivers=[L0] level=Proven
# CHECK: = GetSlot {{*}}key="car" receivers=[L0] level=Proven
